  "id": "6rblzr5",
  "title": "CHAPTER 4: CLIMATE OF RAJASTHAN",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "secc640",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.1 General Climate"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rajasthan has an extreme continental type of climate. Summers are very hot and winters are very cold. The Thar Desert experiences some of the highest temperatures in India during summer (up to 50°C at Churu) and freezing temperatures in winter.",
      "id": "zn3k7d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "m3sbygb",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Season</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Period &amp; Characteristics</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Hot Summer</p>",
            "<p>March to June; max temp 45–50°C; Churu has highest temp</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Monsoon</p>",
            "<p>July to September; Southwest monsoon; SE Rajasthan gets more rain</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Retreating Monsoon</p>",
            "<p>October – November</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Cool Winter</p>",
            "<p>November to February; freezing in Churu, Mount Abu (snowfall possible)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "plbbvn0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.2 Rainfall Distribution"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rajasthan has a highly unequal distribution of rainfall. The eastern and southern parts receive more rainfall, while the western desert receives very little.",
      "id": "8pe743q"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc2xrsy",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Region</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Annual Rainfall</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Districts</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Highest Rainfall</p>",
            "<p>Above 80 cm</p>",
            "<p>Jhalawar, Banswara, Dungarpur</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Moderate Rainfall</p>",
            "<p>40-80 cm</p>",
            "<p>Kota, Bundi, Udaipur, Ajmer</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Low Rainfall</p>",
            "<p>20-40 cm</p>",
            "<p>Jaipur, Jodhpur, Bikaner</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Lowest Rainfall</p>",
            "<p>Below 20 cm</p>",
            "<p>Jaisalmer (&lt;10 cm), Barmer, Ganganagar</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ikiijwa",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.3 Local Winds"
    },
    {
      "id": "75y5f7s",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Wind Name</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Description</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Loo</p>",
            "<p>Hot, dry wind blowing in North-West Rajasthan during summer (April-June). Velocity up to 60 km/hr.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Aandhi</p>",
            "<p>Strong dust storms common in desert region during summer</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Purvaiya (Purwai)</p>",
            "<p>Eastern winds bringing monsoon moisture</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Haveli</p>",
            "<p>Westerly winds in summer</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
